          {
            "text": "The best restaurants in Ayutthaya serve dishes that exemplify the rich culinary scene of the former capital of the Kingdom of Siam. Shaped by its history as a center of global diplomacy, Ayutthaya ’s unique cuisine is a celebration of the freshest ingredients: freshwater fish, river prawns, tropical fruits and verdant greens.",
