            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://en.hoteles.com/go/thailand/ayutthaya",
                "anchor_text": "Ayutthaya"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Indulge in freshly caught broiled river prawns served with a spicy seafood sauce, aromatic boat noodles, creamy tom kha gai and more. Don’t miss the desserts! From coconut custard and mango sticky rice, there are plenty of delightful treats to keep your sweet tooth happy. Travel to the ancient city of Ayutthaya and discover the hidden gems of Thailand’s colorful culinary scene below.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
